  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Online Bureau\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Nov 6, 2026 at 07:44 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Bengaluru: <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+global+enterprise+limited\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Healthcare Global Enterprise Limited</a> (HCG) reported a 15.8 per cent increase in year on year (YoY) revenue from operations to Rs 731.8 crore in the second quarter ended September this year.Adjusted EBITDA increased by 17.2 per cent YoY to Rs 142.5 crore, with adjusted PAT fell 9.3 per cent YoY to Rs 192 crore.HCG said the YoY decline in adjusted PAT primarily reflects a favourable one-time deferred tax adjustment in Q2 FY26 against brought-forward losses and unabsorbed depreciation at Baroda</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>International business revenue grew by approximately 54 per cent YoY to Rs 30.2 crore, driven by increased patient volumes in radiation and medical oncology.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Patient volumes increased by 9 per cent YoY, while ARPP grew by 7 per cent, driven by a favourable payor mix and higher contribution from <a href=\"/tag/advanced+oncology+treatments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">advanced oncology treatments</a>, including robotic surgeries (up 37 per cent YoY) and other high-end therapies, the cancer specialist hospital chain added.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It added 25 operational beds in Q2 FY27, comprising 13 beds in Kenya, 7 in Kolkata and 5 in Nagpur, taking total bed additions to 146 in H1 FY27.Dr. Manish Mattoo, CEO, HCG said,“This performance reflects our continued focus on improving revenue mix, increasing the contribution from high-complexity oncology treatments and driving operational efficiencies. Our strategic emphasis on expanding the non-institutional business continues to enhance the quality of revenue, with its share improving by 325 basis points year-on-year to 69%.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“Looking ahead, our priorities remain focused on improving asset utilisation, accelerating the ramp-up of newer facilities, enhancing productivity across our existing network and executing strategic capacity expansions. We remain committed to delivering sustainable, profitable growth while broadening access to advanced, high-quality cancer care.”</p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Online Bureau</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675629/ETHealthWorld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ETHealthWorld</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                      